{"id":"6b93664396291a47","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem.md","title":"Recursive Enumerations","display":"thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem — Recursive Enumerations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem"],"display":"thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem — Recursive Enumerations","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-thm-selector-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14.7 pp.51-52 / PDF 60-61","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem — Recursive Enumerations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ae8d5f86d63b8a4\" href=\"?note=2ae8d5f86d63b8a4\" title=\"68-thm-selector-theorem\">68-thm-selector-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14.7 pp.51-52 / PDF 60-61"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\)</span> 是值域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=\\aleph_0\">\\(|A|=\\aleph_0\\)</span> 表示 A 无限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|A|=\\aleph_0\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(i)=f(j)\\Rightarrow i=j))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|A|=\\aleph_0\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(i)=f(j)\\Rightarrow i=j))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>14.7，印刷 pp.51–52 / PDF pp.60–61。非空 RE 集先固定一枚已枚举成员，在某一步未出现新成员时重复该值，得到全枚举。无限时逐次等到下一个此前未列出的成员，得到一一全枚举；每次等待均因无限性而终止。反向全递归函数的值域为 RE。非空和无限前提分别是必要的，不能把空集误写成全函数值域，也不能要求有限集合有一一的无限枚举。原书陈述与证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-selector-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"2ae8d5f86d63b8a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-selector-theorem]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"|A|=\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"|A|=\\aleph_0\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(i)=f(j)\\Rightarrow i=j))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1726,"backlinks":[{"id":"d356be4fee142864","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是原书 §14，印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58 的式 (1)，依据 §8 Normal Form Theorem：W_e 是索引函数的定义域，而定义域成员性恰为存在终止计算记录。现显式保留 k，包括 k=0；k=1 即旧一元陈述。这里表述定义域的计算记录表示，并非全递归函数的值域枚举；后者需要非空条件，另见 [[68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem]]。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem|thm-recursive-enumeration-theorem — Recursive Enumerations]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","a82d826d433dcff3","2ae8d5f86d63b8a4"]}